<rml>
<head>
    <title>Card</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="menu.rcss"/>
</head>
<body class="cut">
<!-- A card of text over a picture of the game: up to four lines in the lower third of
     the window. It has no buttons. The game writes the lines and sets, in every frame,
     how much of each thing is there (ui::UiLayer::setOpacity): the black over the
     picture, the card itself, each of its lines and the hint. A line without text has
     no height. The intro shows its five cards of two lines with it (game/Intro.hpp).
     The title card of a night and the ending card (game/Campaign.hpp) are text on
     black: the game then sets the class "middle" on the card, which lifts the lines to
     the middle of the window. -->
<div class="black" id="black"></div>
<div class="story" id="card">
    <div class="story-band"></div>
    <div class="story-lines">
        <div class="story-mark"></div>
        <p class="story-line" id="line-first"></p>
        <p class="story-line second" id="line-second"></p>
        <p class="story-line" id="line-third"></p>
        <p class="story-line second" id="line-fourth"></p>
    </div>
</div>
<p class="keys corner" id="hint">Press any key to skip</p>
</body>
</rml>
